[
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"942100\">@Alfredo Moreira-Rosa</span> <br>\nDoes Std.Http.Server support SSE?<br>\nLLMs services use SSE like <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/streaming-responses\">https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/streaming-responses</a> .</p>",
        "id": 606917929,
        "sender_full_name": "junji hashimoto",
        "timestamp": 1782578739
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Lean <code>Std.Http</code> support streaming, it supports keepalive, so building SSE on top it should be possible.<br>\na reminder that <code>Std.Http</code> is low level library. So you can build a lot on top of it.</p>",
        "id": 606918322,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1782579116
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>nice project!</p>",
        "id": 606921090,
        "sender_full_name": "Asei Inoue",
        "timestamp": 1782581604
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>3 messages were moved here from <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"579630\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/579630-Project-announcements/topic/LeanIO.20.3A.20a.20router.20for.20lean.20Std.2EHttp/with/606917338\">#Project announcements &gt; LeanIO : a router for lean Std.Http</a> by <span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"634338\">Michael Rothgang</span>.</p>",
        "id": 606998414,
        "sender_full_name": "Notification Bot",
        "timestamp": 1782661103
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I published version 0.2.0,</p>\n<p>This reworks the API to support Extractors , just like Rust Axum, a very popular Router for Rust.<br>\nThis hides the low level API of Lean <code>Std.Http</code>, making writing APIs even simpler.<br>\nIt's extensible just like Axum, by implementing Type Classes <code>FromRequestParts</code>, <code>FromRequestBody</code>and <code>IntoResponse</code>.</p>\n<p>Examples :</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Quick Start :</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LeanIO</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LeanIO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Router</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GET</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"/hello\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Hello, world!\"</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Async</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">block</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">addr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Net</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SocketAddress</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">v4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨.</span><span class=\"n\">ofParts</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">127</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8080</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">router</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Router</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Router</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">empty</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|&gt;.</span><span class=\"n\">addRoute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|&gt;.</span><span class=\"n\">addMiddleware</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">requestLogger</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|&gt;.</span><span class=\"n\">addMiddleware</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">catchErrors</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">server</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Server</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">serve</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">addr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">router</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">server</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">waitShutdown</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Using Extractors</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\">-- plain handler — returns a String</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GET</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"/hello\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Hello, world!\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- path parameter extraction</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getItem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GET</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"/items/{id}\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">someItemDb</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">find</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- JSON body extraction</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">createItem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">POST</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"/items\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Json</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CreateItemRequest</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Status</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">created</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Item</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- combined: body + path params</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">updateItem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PUT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"/items/{id}\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Json</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UpdateRequest</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Item</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">update</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">body</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- two path params</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getComment</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GET</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"/items/{id}/comments/{cId}\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cId</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Comment</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">find</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cId</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- catch-all rest param</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">serveFiles</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GET</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"/files/{*rest}\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">rest</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">File</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">serve</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rest</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 607126630,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1782733906
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>A nice and small example of using extractors for pagination, with integrated deriving macro :</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Pagination</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">offset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">limit</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span>\n<span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FromQuery</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">listTodos</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GET</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"/todos\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">ref</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TodoStoreRef</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">page</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Query</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Pagination</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ref</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">todos</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">todos</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">valuesArray</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">min</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">page</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">offset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">todos</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">remaining</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">todos</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">start</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">take</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">min</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">page</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">limit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">remaining</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">todos</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">extract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">take</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 607223881,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1782761230
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Just to show that the macro <code>GET \"/todos\" ...</code> does nothing magical, here's the equivalent with no macro :</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">listTodosHandler</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TodoStoreRef</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Query</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Pagination</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ContextAsync</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Array</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Todo</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">ref</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TodoStoreRef</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">page</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Query</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Pagination</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ref</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">todos</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">todos</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">valuesArray</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">min</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">page</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">offset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">todos</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">remaining</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">todos</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">start</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">take</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">min</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">page</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">limit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">remaining</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">todos</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">extract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">take</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">listTodos</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Route</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"/todos\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Extractor</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">extract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">listTodosHandler</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>All the magic is done by the TypeClasses, not macros.</p>",
        "id": 607254515,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1782774593
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Added support for <code>HTTP</code> range protocol for serving files. This means you can seek remote files from the middle.<br>\n<strong>Allows for resilient downloads :</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>you started downloading</li>\n<li>your internet shutdown</li>\n<li>it goes back up</li>\n<li>you can resume from where you lost connectivity. </li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Allows for video streaming like youtube :</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>you open a video</li>\n<li>you want to skip to the conclusion</li>\n<li>you slide to the end</li>\n<li>you start viewing your video from there without downloading the beginning</li>\n</ul>\n<p>And all this with just 3 lines :</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">serveFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">GET</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"/static/{*rest}\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">rest</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ranges</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">HeaderRange</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">System</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">FilePath</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"static\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rest</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ranges</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">RangeFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 607371587,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1782824824
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Added a toy example of a youtube like website served entirely by Leanio (html, js, videos, apis) :<br>\n<img alt=\"image.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"1893x1104\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/CYz5Kw-ci9w17gfJv82Mv7BF/image.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/CYz5Kw-ci9w17gfJv82Mv7BF/image.png/840x560.webp\"></p>\n<p>Code source <a href=\"https://github.com/ecyrbe/leanio/blob/main/Examples/LeanPlay/Main.lean\">here</a> (generated by AI)</p>",
        "id": 607426009,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1782838078
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>New release 0.3 ! I added support for :</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Form (aka application/x-www-form-urlencoded)</li>\n<li>MultipartForm(aka multipart/form-data)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These allow to handle Forms and file uploads in forms. It's been optimised to support steaming. So you can send Gigabytes files and the server will be able to stream it directly to the file system without consuming more memory. Using a zero copy ChunkBuffer to be able to do so.</p>\n<p>Example on how to use Form and MultipartForm <a href=\"https://github.com/ecyrbe/leanio/blob/main/Examples/Upload.lean\">here</a></p>",
        "id": 608118255,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1783103729
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>New release 0.4 !! added support for :</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Proper Cache Control directives with sensible presets</li>\n<li>File and FileRange now support Browser Caching with proper Cache Control with ETag management (based on last modified Timestamp + File Size like nginx does)</li>\n<li>BrowserCached result type, that allows to easily tell the Browser to cache your dynamically generated content (support Json and plainText for now, but it's extensible)</li>\n</ul>",
        "id": 608687409,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1783423750
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>New release 0.5.0 !! Upgraded to lean 4.32.0 and :</p>\n<ul>\n<li>new extractor to extract remote IP address</li>\n<li>Body extensions to allow future compression like gzip (generic stream piping utilities)</li>\n<li>Better Extractor error handling that will pave the way for customisable errors emited by LeanIO (for example to send RFC 9457 Json errors)</li>\n</ul>",
        "id": 610613712,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1784045012
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>One of the nice feature of extractors, is that you can compose them. <br>\nImagine an endpoint where you want to support both <code>Json</code> for standard API call or <code>Form</code> for in browser Form submission.<br>\nYou can have the same endpoint handle it nicely :</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CreateUser</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">email</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span>\n<span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FromJson</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FromForm</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ToJson</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">createUser</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">POST</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"/users\"</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Json</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CreateUser</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊕</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Form</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CreateUser</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CreateUser</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Sum</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">body</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Sum</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">value</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Status</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">created</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 611452892,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1784395955
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>it could be to support XML and JSON and Form at the same time!</p>",
